-- Teaching series (kind 'series'), redone on 20 Oct 2026 from the sermon cards, and one series for each
-- year's 40 Days of Fasting & Prayer. All are drafts (status 'draft'). Each teaching is one full sermon,
-- stored as a path_days row (day = teaching number), played from teaching_start (the card's preaching
-- start; null: the beginning). focus_start/focus_end mark where the teaching is clearest and
-- key_at/key_title/key_quote one key moment.
-- Idempotent: re-running updates the text and teachings in place and removes teachings beyond each
-- series' last one. It never changes status, so a series the ministry has published stays published.
--
-- The topical series follow the same picking rules as the guided paths (supabase/seed/paths.sql). A fast
-- series holds that year's fast only, in day order, one teaching per session with preaching by Apostle
-- Arome Osayi: from the ministry's sermon cut of the day where one was uploaded soon after, else the
-- service upload. Days with no upload, prayer-only sessions, uploads over 3 hours and garbled captions
-- are left out, never filled from another event. 2021's fast (October-November 2021) is prayer vigils
-- with almost no teaching, so it has no series.
--
-- Each new key_quote is the sermon's caption words with only capitalisation and punctuation added,
-- inside one stored passage (teachings kept from before may also drop a stutter or filler, as approved
-- on 15 Oct); key_at is about 3 s before its first word. Times are in seconds.
--
-- Requires the paths migration (20261015000100_paths.sql), the teaching series migration
-- (20261015001000_teaching_series.sql), the teaching start migration
-- (20261020000300_path_days_teaching_start.sql) and the sermon catalogue.

begin;

insert into public.paths (id, kind, name, italic, promise, why, needs, minutes_per_day, status, sort) values
  ('building-on-the-right-foundation', 'series', 'Building on the right foundation', 'the right foundation',
   'From what salvation is to a steady, growing walk with God: twelve foundations to build on.',
   'For new believers and anyone who never had a solid grounding. It starts with what salvation is and how it begins (turning to God, resting in his cleansing, the new birth), then settles who you now are (a new creation, made righteous in Christ, supplied by grace, baptised into his body), then builds the daily habits (the Word, the secret place, gathering with the church) and ends with growing up: the lifelong salvation of the soul.',
   array[]::text[], 20, 'draft', 101),
  ('knowing-the-holy-spirit', 'series', 'Knowing the Holy Spirit', 'the Holy Spirit',
   'Meet the Holy Spirit as a person, then learn step by step to be filled, taught and led by him every day.',
   'For believers who know about the Holy Spirit but want to walk with him. It starts with who he is and how he comes to live in your spirit, then shows how he fills you with power and builds daily practice: praying in tongues, fellowship with him, his inner teaching and leading. Later teachings cover his gifts and his anointing to do good and how to honour his lordship, and the series ends with walking in the Spirit day by day.',
   array[]::text[], 19, 'draft', 102),
  ('the-way-of-the-cross', 'series', 'The way of the cross', 'the cross',
   'Six days to see what Jesus did on the cross, what it makes you and how to live the crucified life.',
   'For believers who want to understand what the cross accomplished and what it asks of them. It starts with why Jesus died and the exchange he made in our place, then shows that you died and rose with him. It ends with taking up your cross daily and letting God patiently deal with self.',
   array[]::text[], 21, 'draft', 103),
  ('living-by-faith', 'series', 'Living by faith', 'by faith',
   'Six teachings that take faith from what it is to how it speaks, waits and endures.',
   'For believers who want faith that is real and steady, not hype. It starts with what faith is and where it comes from (God''s spoken word), then shows faith taking hold of what God has said and speaking it. It ends with the fight of faith, the patience it needs and the endurance that sees the invisible, so that faith holds to the end.',
   array[]::text[], 19, 'draft', 104),
  ('seeking-the-face-of-god', 'series', 'Seeking the face of God', 'the face',
   'Seven days to hunger for God himself, meet him in secret and be changed by beholding him.',
   'For any believer, including someone new to faith, who wants God himself and not only his help. The path begins with what seeking his face means and the thirst that draws us beyond the crowd, then shows that intimacy is personal and private. It moves into the secret place and ministering to the Lord, and ends with friendship with God and being changed by beholding him.',
   array[]::text[], 19, 'draft', 105),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2026', 'series', '40 Days of Fasting & Prayer 2026', 'Fasting & Prayer',
   'The 2026 fast, day by day: freedom from witchcraft and curses, and the victory Christ has won.',
   'For anyone who wants to walk through the 2026 fast with the Apostle. It begins with how witchcraft and curses work and how Christ''s righteousness breaks them, then moves through the strong man and the believer''s dominion. It ends in Ephesians: seated with Christ, walking worthy and standing in holiness. Days with no recorded teaching are left out.',
   array[]::text[], 19, 'draft', 106),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2025', 'series', '40 Days of Fasting & Prayer 2025', 'Fasting & Prayer',
   'The 2025 fast, day by day: understanding the prophetic and growing strong in spirit.',
   'For anyone who wants to walk through the 2025 fast with the Apostle. It starts with the human spirit (the candle of the Lord) and how to exercise it, then moves to seeking God''s face, moving his hand through his promises, walking with the Holy Spirit and the prophetic church. It ends with intimacy and alignment with God. Days with no recorded teaching are left out.',
   array[]::text[], 19, 'draft', 107),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2024', 'series', '40 Days of Fasting & Prayer 2024', 'Fasting & Prayer',
   'The 2024 fast, day by day: the science of altars and a life of prayer before God.',
   'For anyone who wants to walk through the 2024 fast with the Apostle. It begins with sacrifice and the offerings that point to Christ, then builds personal and family altars of prayer and shows how Christ''s authority overcomes every other altar. It ends with hearing God and reading his signs. Days with no recorded teaching are left out.',
   array[]::text[], 20, 'draft', 108),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2023', 'series', '40 Days of Fasting & Prayer 2023', 'Fasting & Prayer',
   'The 2023 fast, day by day: honouring God and winning the battles of the mind, body and finances.',
   'For anyone who wants to walk through the 2023 fast with the Apostle. It opens with spiritual covering and the law of honour, then teaches spiritual warfare domain by domain: the mind, the body and finances, with stewardship and true prosperity along the way. The recordings stop at day 25, and days with no recorded teaching are left out.',
   array[]::text[], 19, 'draft', 109),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2022', 'series', '40 Days of Fasting & Prayer 2022', 'Fasting & Prayer',
   'The 2022 fast, day by day: the season of watchmen, who watch and pray for God''s purposes.',
   'For anyone who wants to walk through the 2022 fast with the Apostle. It introduces the watchmen God sets over families and nations, then teaches how to read his signs, hear his announcements and answer his summons to prayer. It ends with the watchman''s warning ministry and the value of the body of Christ. Days with no recorded teaching are left out.',
   array[]::text[], 20, 'draft', 110)
on conflict (id) do update set
  kind = excluded.kind,
  name = excluded.name,
  italic = excluded.italic,
  promise = excluded.promise,
  why = excluded.why,
  needs = excluded.needs,
  minutes_per_day = excluded.minutes_per_day,
  sort = excluded.sort;

insert into public.path_days (path_id, day, youtube_id, focus_start, focus_end, theme, key_at, key_title, teaching_start, key_quote) values
  ('building-on-the-right-foundation', 1, 'UcPjUPgXIFY', 2192.2, 3685.6, 'Saved from sin into a whole new life', 2837.9, 'Saved Into Life', 109.0,
   'The gospel that the apostles preach provided salvation from the principles, the power and the presence of sin.'),
  ('building-on-the-right-foundation', 2, 'kJGclK58IcY', 1183.1, 2390.8, 'Turning from rebellion to God''s rule', 1251.9, 'Turn Around', 125.0,
   'That''s why the first kingdom message is about repentance. We will need to turn around. We need to give up our ways of rebellion.'),
  ('building-on-the-right-foundation', 3, 'akEzdX2szNc', 2566.3, 3711.8, 'Stay in the light when you stumble', 3505.3, 'No Condemnation in Christ', 1245.0,
   'Therefore when God looks at you God treats you from the standpoint of Jesus''s merit. That is why it is in Christ Jesus that there''s no condemnation.'),
  ('building-on-the-right-foundation', 4, 'Rr5boYY_oHY', 3644.9, 5091.0, 'Born of the Spirit to see God''s kingdom', 5039.1, 'The New Birth', 698.0,
   'Your being born again gives you the opportunity of perception, then after perception you will need choice to walk under God''s government.'),
  ('building-on-the-right-foundation', 5, 'Lxu4HOL1cYI', 2563.4, 3389.3, 'Know who you have become in Christ', 3017.2, 'A New Creation', 120.0,
   'The reason why you are living now as a new creation is that you are living by the Holy Spirit. It means that your life cannot be the way it was.'),
  ('building-on-the-right-foundation', 6, 'ouWUxYN3YU4', 690.7, 1786.5, 'Christ himself made your righteousness', 1619.2, 'Christ Our Righteousness', 0.0,
   'It didn''t say that the righteousness of Christ becomes our righteousness. No, he said Christ is our righteousness.'),
  ('building-on-the-right-foundation', 7, 'IsR9D3SXg_A', 759.3, 2167.5, 'Grace has already supplied what you need', 1836.6, 'Blessed Before You Came', 1.0,
   'So he is not about to bless you. It was already there before you were brought into the economy.'),
  ('building-on-the-right-foundation', 8, 'HJCY8Mu9vzg', 3955.3, 5205.2, 'Covenant signs: the cup and the water', 4503.8, 'Cup and Water', 1535.0,
   'Your baptism is a declaration to this world that I''ve passed on from you. I''m no longer part of you.'),
  ('building-on-the-right-foundation', 9, 'Twf18R60vr0', 1565.5, 3146.9, 'Build on the Word: hear it and do it', 3087.4, 'Built on the Word', 0.0,
   'The difference between your physical mirror and the mirror of the word of God is that the mirror of God''s word reveals who you are supposed to be.'),
  ('building-on-the-right-foundation', 10, '1EZ0kLqjx8w', 3226.7, 4366.6, 'Seek Christ daily in the secret place', 3817.7, 'With Your Entire Heart', 183.0,
   'When you finish crying, wipe your tears and go and look for Christ. You will need more than tears to find him, you will need your entire heart.'),
  ('building-on-the-right-foundation', 11, 'MA1Z9iT7wX0', 2327.6, 3538.2, 'Gathering with believers where God meets us', 2967.3, 'Meeting Together', 185.0,
   'So in our fellowship meetings, the people we interact with, the personalities we interact with are not just the physical personalities that are present in church.'),
  ('building-on-the-right-foundation', 12, 'RmwJQKsQQMg', 0.2, 756.2, 'Saved, being saved, and yet to be saved', 284.4, 'Growing Up in God', 0.2,
   'It is true when we say we are saved. It is also still true when we say we are being saved.'),
  ('knowing-the-holy-spirit', 1, 'U8__koxVO7E', 659.2, 2109.3, 'A Person you can know, not a force', 1577.0, 'A Real Person', 0.0,
   'That was when I knew that the Holy Ghost was a person, not because I saw it in scripture; I experienced him.'),
  ('knowing-the-holy-spirit', 2, 'g1HgUhTCuw8', 1140.6, 2221.0, 'The Spirit lives in you to stay', 1873.4, 'A Resident Spiritual Capital', 256.0,
   'The spirit of God dwells in me. There is a resource base, there is a spiritual capital that is not coming and going; it is resident and I can take full advantage of the possibilities that it brings.'),
  ('knowing-the-holy-spirit', 3, 'dWukrTfLoh4', 1632.5, 2788.8, 'Joined to the Lord as one spirit', 1792.2, 'The Spirit in You', 179.0,
   'When you gave your life to Christ, what God did is that he established the economy called one Spirit: your spirit and the Holy Spirit mingled together to form an economy.'),
  ('knowing-the-holy-spirit', 4, 'L1S2ebzLRTc', 2579.8, 3579.3, 'Ask, receive and speak', 3435.1, 'Filled with Power', 2441.0,
   'That means if you ask him for the Holy Ghost, he will never deny you.'),
  ('knowing-the-holy-spirit', 5, 'Tl0qEn10FjA', 5277.5, 6697.5, 'Tongues that build you up', 6503.7, 'Praying in Tongues', 3302.0,
   'So speaking in tongues is an avenue to access spiritual rest and spiritual refreshing.'),
  ('knowing-the-holy-spirit', 6, 'scNJvOyzHZU', 935.1, 2100.2, 'A friendship you build on purpose', 1504.6, 'Communion with Him', 0.0,
   'God wants you to have a secret life with him.'),
  ('knowing-the-holy-spirit', 7, 'P5nM7Q6ytBw', 1113.1, 2225.6, 'The anointing within that teaches you', 1637.2, 'Your Inner Teacher', 89.0,
   'The anointing within is for your maturity; the anointing upon is for ministry.'),
  ('knowing-the-holy-spirit', 8, 'FFxKz7PKqMw', 3572.9, 4724.0, 'Telling his leading from your own noise', 4289.7, 'Led from Within', 768.0,
   'The thoughts that come from your human Spirit, they are in line with the word of God; the thoughts that come from your soul, they are contradictory with the word of God.'),
  ('knowing-the-holy-spirit', 9, 'sqxHVEU1LU8', 884.2, 2162.3, 'Different gifts, one Spirit', 1347.2, 'Gifts of the Spirit', 14.0,
   'God can manage you as an individual because he has the administration to do that and that''s why he is not afraid of diversity.'),
  ('knowing-the-holy-spirit', 10, '2z12UoP47sI', 2155.1, 3288.2, 'Anointed to do good', 2988.6, 'The Anointing', 226.0,
   'The bottom line is this: you are therefore empowered to do good.'),
  ('knowing-the-holy-spirit', 11, 'YZFkiPvUELo', 2159.3, 3288.2, 'Honour his lordship, guard his peace', 2668.0, 'Do Not Grieve Him', 6.0,
   'The snail is very sensitive. I need you to understand that the Holy Spirit is more sensitive than that snail.'),
  ('knowing-the-holy-spirit', 12, '02FxbkyFBds', 199.9, 1220.3, 'Learning to walk, step by step', 536.4, 'Walking in the Spirit', 97.0,
   'Just walk with God and everything that you need for life and for godliness will begin to navigate in your direction.'),
  ('the-way-of-the-cross', 1, 'm45YrDepYoU', 3912.3, 5254.3, 'The cross brought God''s rule to earth', 5070.2, 'Governmental Displacement', 1017.0,
   'The meaning of the cross is the payment that was needed to bring the throne of God and make it efficacious upon the face of the earth.'),
  ('the-way-of-the-cross', 2, '7aablIT_eDU', 341.6, 1501.8, 'He took our place, we take his', 1145.6, 'The great exchange', 0.0,
   'It''s not change, but it''s exchange. Exchange. That''s the testimony of the Christian life.'),
  ('the-way-of-the-cross', 3, 'cT18hXCRnhw', 143.2, 1207.6, 'You died with Christ to the old', 343.5, 'Included in His Death', 9.0,
   'When Jesus died and we were included in his death by an act of the authority of God, we were separated from the fallen creation.'),
  ('the-way-of-the-cross', 4, 'AWKMSeH9PZ8', 4770.2, 6098.0, 'Dead to sin, alive to God', 5834.4, 'Raised with him', 4880.0,
   'My lot and portion experientially on the account of his resurrection is that I am sentenced to a life that is alive to God.'),
  ('the-way-of-the-cross', 5, 'ZX6Pclkydp8', 3278.1, 4362.2, 'Deny yourself and take up your cross', 3902.5, 'Meeting Your Cross', 1009.0,
   'Now, if you don''t have the culture of denying self, if you have not trained yourself that way, when you meet your cross, you''ll not be able to carry it.'),
  ('the-way-of-the-cross', 6, 'gZfqrw9NaOo', 4037.4, 5424.1, 'God''s dealings turn Jacob into Israel', 5412.7, 'From Jacob to Israel', 138.0,
   'There must be a transition. Israel must come out of Jacob in order for him to inherit the things that God has ordained.'),
  ('living-by-faith', 1, 'mrXgkyh2uSk', 133.1, 1367.0, 'Faith is substance, not slogans', 202.6, 'The substance of faith', 95.0,
   'He did not say faith is a substance, but faith is the substance. It is the substance that brings certainty to hope.'),
  ('living-by-faith', 2, 'loQOKaz_AMA', 1140.5, 2296.2, 'Faith grows from God''s spoken word', 1754.8, 'The word of faith', 50.0,
   'Build capacity in the spirit for you to be able to trust God because your life depends on the spoken word of God.'),
  ('living-by-faith', 3, 'SEa4g26NQf4', 3210.0, 4346.2, 'Faith takes hold of what God says', 3904.6, 'Going With Promises', 198.0,
   'We go with promises in our spirit and because of the promises that we believe the hand of God is released to protect what he has said to protect his integrity.'),
  ('living-by-faith', 4, 'VkxESOM4ztk', 3080.5, 4257.2, 'Holding on when circumstances say no', 3985.0, 'Stronger Than the Storm', 201.0,
   'And in obeying God, even though the storm came, what was happening in your heart was stronger than the storm. That''s why you survived.'),
  ('living-by-faith', 5, '57GQMbk3qF8', 0.1, 1266.6, 'Keep your confidence while faith waits', 789.1, 'Faith takes patience', 0.0,
   'If the substance is in view, your waiting is a day closer to a time of manifestation.'),
  ('living-by-faith', 6, '5e64V-F8ov4', 3399.8, 4374.4, 'Faith endures by seeing the invisible', 3683.8, 'An Encounter for Ailing Faith', 1318.0,
   'The first thing that God does to you to help your faith that is ailing is that he gives you an encounter.'),
  ('seeking-the-face-of-god', 1, 'c2rUz3C_fXY', 1424.2, 3070.6, 'Meet God personally and leave at rest', 3039.6, 'Seeking God''s face', 643.0,
   'If you have had this experience before, it takes away anxiety, it takes away fear, it takes away worry, and he brings ventilation and you are at rest inside.'),
  ('seeking-the-face-of-god', 2, 'PbbziOT2A0k', 1799.6, 2876.2, 'A thirst that goes beyond the crowd', 2261.3, 'Beyond the Congregation', 410.0,
   'This means God goes beyond the level of the congregation. Many people are already satisfied at the congregation level.'),
  ('seeking-the-face-of-god', 3, 'VqExQDYSM30', 2777.4, 3924.1, 'Intimacy with God is personal and private', 3159.4, 'Faith in a Person', 1327.0,
   'Our faith in the New Testament is faith in a person, not faith in an idea, not faith in a thing, faith in the Man called Jesus Christ. That''s what makes us different.'),
  ('seeking-the-face-of-god', 4, 'vOmSY83tJg0', 2908.6, 4322.2, 'Meeting the Father in the secret place', 3308.7, 'The Father in Secret', 1159.0,
   'The first definition of our Father is that our Father is in secret, so it will take an activity that is domiciled in secret to engage the God that is in secret.'),
  ('seeking-the-face-of-god', 5, 'lltproBK5oU', 2113.9, 3419.0, 'Learning to minister to the Lord', 2261.4, 'Ministering Unto the Lord', 210.0,
   'There is no time in the entire scripture that men began to minister unto the Lord that God didn''t speak.'),
  ('seeking-the-face-of-god', 6, 'M5ZrmQkfL0g', 452.3, 1493.8, 'Friends who know his heart', 807.6, 'Discerning God''s Heart', 427.0,
   'You are likely to come to that place when you can actually figure out what God is thinking, what is bothering God, what is on the mind of God, what is troubling the heart of God.'),
  ('seeking-the-face-of-god', 7, '4vIhtZaB1FQ', 3285.7, 4450.7, 'Changed by beholding his glory', 4037.3, 'The Way of Transformation', 1440.0,
   'The reason why you cannot do without it is because that is God''s way of achieving transformation.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2026', 1, 'ikkmF5iwatI', 2081.4, 3129.3, 'Witchcraft begins with commitment to self', 2564.1, 'The Alternative God', 1.0,
   'Anyone that is committed to honoring self will not honor the Lord because self is an alternative God.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2026', 2, 'lQPZIpGMKVU', 1057.2, 2083.0, 'Discerning and answering the mind of witchcraft', 1463.4, 'Destroy the Utterance', 135.0,
   'Tell the witch that I will not only see the end of the year, I will see the end of many more years and your utterance will have no power over me.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2026', 3, 'XvdO2y16igE', 3266.3, 4289.0, 'The name of Jesus works in every terrain', 3870.9, 'The Same Testimony', 1830.0,
   'It means that the resources that Jesus gave them to function with could operate irrespective of their maturity level and irrespective of the demonic terrain around their destiny.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2026', 4, '49EE8wZJ9Sk', 5677.4, 6788.6, 'Spells are weapons that cannot prosper', 6364.3, 'The Proof of Victory', 2424.0,
   'See, the proof that you won in a spiritual warfare is that you will see a new season, a new manifestation that resulted from your spiritual effort because the two realms are linked.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2026', 5, 'G31-LvVOfks', 3115.4, 4109.2, 'Righteousness breaks the power of curses', 3724.7, 'No Iniquity in Jacob', 423.0,
   'And if you are righteous, you cannot be cursed because a curse is a judgment.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2026', 6, 'Ql5kOtPaD5Q', 2609.6, 3786.9, 'Abiding in Christ to draw His grace', 3298.3, 'The Abiding Branch', 2253.0,
   'If you are going to be nourished by the grace that comes from Christ, you will need to abide in him.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2026', 7, 'tXqiC0561s4', 3245.0, 4414.3, 'Salvation equips you to break curses', 4084.1, 'The Legal Ground', 1736.0,
   'Your salvation does not remove you from the consequence of a curse. But your salvation equips you with the tools with which to invalidate the legality upon which the curse is based.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2026', 8, 'T_sSQCYY18c', 2232.5, 3443.1, 'The judicial foundation of the gospel', 2308.8, 'The Judicial Arrangement', 2232.0,
   'The extent to which you know the judicial arrangement behind the good news, the more you are likely to enter into the benefit of that judicial arrangement.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2026', 9, 'H3G-F_8PGYA', 378.5, 1822.8, 'The enemy seeks legal ground against you', 672.5, 'Curses Need Legal Ground', 136.0,
   'You know, I told you that curses are judgments. And a curse that doesn''t have a certified legal premise will not rest.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2026', 10, 'zgTFaaNHSxY', 1459.0, 2808.2, 'Righteousness that becomes a lifestyle', 2018.8, 'Practical Righteousness', 1456.0,
   'The way we will know that you have met the Lord is when you begin to do righteousness. See, this one is practical righteousness.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2026', 11, 'ujfvWElg9Cs', 4041.2, 5334.7, 'Divine prosperity endures through famine', 5014.9, 'Prosperity That Endures', 123.0,
   'But if it''s divine prosperity and it stems out of your relationship with God and the strategies of the Holy Ghost, it will endure.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2026', 12, 'iheLnPwjDSI', 330.9, 1569.7, 'Living as Jesus lived through the Spirit', 1261.4, 'Christ Our Syllabus', 331.0,
   'Everything that he did in the flesh is what we are capable of doing by the enhancement of the Holy Ghost.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2026', 13, 'A52VOEnneR4', 2790.7, 3824.4, 'Intimacy with God unlocks spiritual strength', 3459.6, 'Intimacy Unlocks His Ways', 709.0,
   'Can you see that the ways of God are hidden in a mystery? Is only those that get to become intimate with God that understand his ways and can administer his will.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2026', 14, 'HAkTCpmQInM', 1621.6, 2729.4, 'Give the strong man no room to stay', 2055.3, 'God Comes to Take Over', 1.0,
   'When God comes into the life of a man, he doesn''t come to squat. He comes to take over.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2026', 15, 'RKkV-sZMq9Q', 1518.9, 2503.8, 'Grace empowers us to live above sin', 1760.0, 'The Proof of Grace', 139.0,
   'So Jesus came to defeat sin. The proof that Jesus has released grace upon my life is that I am capable of living above sin.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2026', 16, 'tvULvD2SGS8', 2398.3, 3069.2, 'Closing the open doors to the enemy', 2648.1, 'Show God Your Wounds', 162.0,
   'Many of you come to church and you don''t show God your wounds. You just hide it up.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2026', 17, 'FcWwOxa4Klk', 1182.3, 2374.7, 'Courage to possess your God-given allocation', 1840.4, 'A Risk Worth Taking', 1182.0,
   'Faith is a risk, but it''s a risk worth taking because you know that God is the one that furnished it in your heart.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2026', 18, '4dI5ckJgpXE', 2969.8, 4004.3, 'Grace makes the impossible possible', 3751.2, 'The Mark of Grace', 2.0,
   'Grace will make something happen when there is no suggestion that it can survive. That''s when we say there''s grace.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2026', 19, 'NM1WSYLmaCU', 0.1, 1214.5, 'Staying with Jesus equips you for battle', 401.7, 'Being With Him', 0.0,
   'You are there to be with him when you are sent. Therefore, the things that you have learned from him while you were with him will become your response.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2026', 20, '6EuJB8gRBWs', 535.8, 1691.4, 'God''s presence overcomes the spirit of Dagon', 690.7, 'Carriers of His Presence', 184.0,
   'We are carriers of his presence. So you need to do what it takes in order for the presence of God to identify with you.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2026', 21, '5vKA3QquzhU', 3222.8, 4497.1, 'Faith in the name of Jesus', 4263.2, 'Faith in His Name', 2282.0,
   'So part of the reason why they preached the name of Jesus was so that each believer could have faith in the name of Jesus.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2026', 22, 'oK8DAd9Eqns', 2641.7, 3577.3, 'Guard your heart and your words', 3537.4, 'Cancelling Negative Words', 408.0,
   'So we are using the utterance that is in the blood of Jesus to subdue every negative utterance.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2026', 23, 'uLSzVIwR_CI', 2172.1, 3365.1, 'Guard your heart beyond your anointing', 2274.3, 'Where the Heart Strays', 1.0,
   'God created Lucifer. Lucifer''s heart went to places he should not go and he became Satan.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2026', 24, 'dIvPwlFt9-I', 764.4, 1880.1, 'Victory rests on what Jesus secured', 1429.7, 'Not a Fresh Battle', 174.0,
   'In spiritual warfare, you are not fighting a fresh battle. No, you are operating in the victory that has already been secured.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2026', 25, 'TngwPWUg1fQ', 2291.0, 3367.5, 'Sit by resting your weight on Christ', 2613.8, 'Living at His Expense', 0.0,
   'That means you are not living life at your expense but you are living life at his expense. Your weight is transferred.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2026', 26, 'NNFD05-QEQQ', 388.6, 1532.8, 'Victory begins with Christ''s finished work', 429.3, 'Acceptance by Faith', 389.0,
   'Every new spiritual experience begins with an acceptance by faith of what God has done. Each successive stage of the Christian life follows on the same divinely determined principle.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2026', 27, 'fxORkBiWxXs', 1468.5, 2486.3, 'Rest in grace before you walk', 2109.6, 'Grace Has No Limit', 1464.0,
   'I found out that grace doesn''t have any limit. The extent to which you are willing to go is the extent to which grace can take you.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2026', 28, 'ZX6Pclkydp8', 3148.6, 4362.2, 'Deny self and carry your cross', 4107.3, 'The Basis of Holiness', 1009.0,
   'The cross is the basis of the work of holiness. The blood is the basis of redemption.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2025', 1, 'HtC2Kp3HPEo', 947.2, 2092.4, 'Your spirit is the candle of the Lord', 1034.5, 'The Candle of the Lord', 785.0,
   'His candle, that which happens to be the spirit of man, is the first point God engages when he shows up in the room.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2025', 2, 'zOt-g0Wixm0', 1286.5, 2393.1, 'Keeping a good conscience before God', 1994.9, 'Conscience and Faith', 50.0,
   'An aligned heart is that heart that has the capacity for confidence, for faith, for assurance. So the state of your conscience will determine your faith capacity.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2025', 3, 'oqWvuGBIPMA', 1671.3, 3070.8, 'Exercising your spirit to grow strong', 2965.9, 'The Spiritual Gym', 1.0,
   'If you quit the physical gym, don''t quit spiritual gym, because if you quit the spiritual gym you will never become that man that is filled with wisdom.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2025', 4, 'mI3K87qWPZU', 3752.0, 4761.1, 'Exercise your spirit to grow strong', 4069.9, 'Take the Initiative', 2603.0,
   'You must take the initiative to exercise your spirit before you begin to profit.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2025', 5, 'tjE2eayunkM', 1681.7, 3121.6, 'Exercise your spirit to lift spiritual weights', 2961.2, 'Exercise Builds Capacity', 0.0,
   'And the level of spiritual agility, spiritual capacity that you have is a function of how much exercise you were willing to invest.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2025', 6, '7o9FNOsi_Fc', 3686.2, 5098.7, 'Exercise your spirit to manifest Christ''s victory', 4223.4, 'Victories in the Holy Ghost', 3406.0,
   'So this is what happens when you begin to exercise your spirit and you engage the enemy, the victories that are in him will begin to manifest in your own situation.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2025', 7, 'c2rUz3C_fXY', 1532.4, 2602.4, 'Seeking God''s face with persistence', 1942.4, 'Seek Until You Find', 643.0,
   'When you start seeking God''s face you don''t stop until you find what you are seeking.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2025', 8, 'LqwGGb7jegk', 450.6, 1727.2, 'Seeking out the God who hides Himself', 1077.7, 'Constrain Him', 451.0,
   'It is his nature for him to conceal himself, to confine himself, to hide himself; so it is now your responsibility to reach out and to constrain him.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2025', 9, 'Pf2CS3shnBE', 3524.1, 4880.9, 'Pray within the scope of God''s word', 4174.2, 'Configure Your Requests', 2196.0,
   'So if you want to move the hand of God, first thing that you need to do is to configure all your requests according to the provisions in the word of God.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2025', 10, 'SEa4g26NQf4', 928.3, 1939.6, 'Labour in prayer for God''s promise', 1715.3, 'A Word From His Mouth', 198.0,
   'If you want to see God''s hand you will need to labor around him to get a word from his mouth.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2025', 11, 'qjOhYBKL8Qs', 2129.9, 3223.8, 'The strength of a diverse body', 2342.4, 'The Antioch Vision', 704.0,
   'It was multilingual, it was multiracial and it was multinational and that was the vision that Jesus had that Christianity will not be held in the handcuffs of racism.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2025', 12, 'TtAwKXoxk6Q', 2466.3, 3669.7, 'The Holy Ghost shows what lies behind', 3225.3, 'No More Shadow Boxing', 184.0,
   'If you are not exposed to the showings of the Holy Ghost, you might be shadow boxing. Shadow boxing is when people are fighting the wrong things because they don''t know what is responsible.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2025', 13, '0fdlRiAo6k4', 6749.7, 7915.4, 'God shares His Spirit with His people', 7431.4, 'The Division of Moses', 6568.0,
   'At the end of the day everybody is going to be in possession of what makes Moses Moses because the spirit that is upon Moses will become available to 70 more individuals in the camp.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2025', 14, '-v1JtDH1Scs', 1458.7, 2531.3, 'Maturing until God can trust you with souls', 1630.6, 'Trusted With Spiritual Things', 1459.0,
   'You will go beyond the realm where we trust you with administrative things to the realm where we trust you with spiritual things.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2025', 15, '0EaiTxIKum0', 2308.6, 3383.8, 'Hearing and keeping the sounds of heaven', 2972.2, 'Hidden in a Song', 25.0,
   'That moment is lost but it was not designed to be lost. It was designed to be hidden either in a song or in a scripture that will become your scripture and your song.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2025', 16, '2gZaCk4jX2Y', 3438.8, 4503.3, 'The Spirit leads us into real encounter', 3850.5, 'Into the Reality', 2429.0,
   'He does not speak about the things; he brings you into the reality of those things and he gives you an experience of those things, so that you will become the one to speak about the things.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2025', 17, 'GZoCiHjuKJg', 4795.9, 6103.5, 'Choosing to live under God''s government', 5958.0, 'Savior and Lord', 0.0,
   'In salvation you meet a savior, but in Kingdom you meet the Lord.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2025', 18, 'G6zjUHg0VEw', 4536.7, 5485.3, 'Entering God''s rest through praying in tongues', 5080.4, 'Rest Comes First', 0.0,
   'Before God changes your circumstances he will change you; he brings you into rest first.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2025', 19, 'Pfi9dHHNJFY', 2095.8, 3333.6, 'Letting God think through your thoughts', 2149.2, 'Reasoning With God', 0.0,
   'He wants your thoughts to come into the force field of his own thoughts so that you can reason according to his thoughts. That''s when you will understand his ways.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2025', 20, 'tX8WsKLp-s8', 2732.4, 3729.6, 'Purity unlocks the power of His name', 3082.7, 'The Power Will Return', 2074.0,
   'The power of God will return to his house the moment we begin to amend our ways and to accept that the God with which we have to do is a God that is pure, a God that is holy.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2024', 1, 'nFjHGDzXJ0o', 584.6, 1869.9, 'An altar speaks the language of sacrifice', 833.1, 'The Dialect of Sacrifice', 447.0,
   'So an altar is a metaphor that depicts sacrifice and sacrifice is the dialect that spirits understand.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2024', 2, 'mgnUXY9cp70', 2555.7, 3932.0, 'Righteous through Christ our substitute', 2932.7, 'The Gift of Righteousness', 1136.0,
   'Your status of righteousness within the context of the New Testament and the New Covenant is not a function of what you did; it''s a function of what Jesus did.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2024', 3, 'e_C3w6eNyAE', 2137.6, 3391.0, 'Christ''s blood secures our peace with God', 3325.5, 'Organic Peace', 133.0,
   'When I say organic peace I''m talking about peace that is a function of the life of God that is operational in your spirit. If you are in alignment with God that peace will be boosted.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2024', 4, 'cyTkwkLjtEE', 2680.0, 4147.6, 'Living a life that satisfies God', 3993.1, 'A Life That Satisfies', 1767.0,
   'That kind of life that is sold out to God, that is willing to please God, willing to express God, is a life that satisfies God.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2024', 5, 'og2rvOOjk1k', 1383.2, 2583.6, 'Approaching the invisible God by faith', 1710.7, 'Doing Business by Faith', 1383.0,
   'He that comes to God must be ready to do business on the strength of his faith because he wants to transact with intangible things that his physical senses cannot verify.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2024', 6, '0OPBXGN3OYI', 2752.2, 3937.2, 'The altar as a place of personal communion', 3380.3, 'Encounters Unique to You', 1218.0,
   'It means that there are encounters that only you will have in the presence of God. God can sponsor specific encounters that are unique to you.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2024', 7, 'aaAtPjO4FhI', 747.7, 2007.3, 'Enforcing God''s will through the altar', 1910.1, 'Enforcing God''s Will', 22.0,
   'We know it''s God''s will for you to live long, but the will of God will not just come to pass because it is God; it will come to pass because it''s enforced.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2024', 8, '7blNLGAnX_c', 1270.5, 2495.8, 'A personal altar begins with a vow', 2370.4, 'The Avowed Attendant', 29.0,
   'Every altar must have a human attendant and the human attendant must be an avowed attendant.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2024', 9, 'L3RetuGcmO4', 1399.7, 2518.0, 'God comes to govern your life', 1922.7, 'The Tone of a Master', 645.0,
   'The tone with which your supervising spirit will come is the tone of a king, the tone of a governor, the tone of a master.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2024', 10, 'PjJ4YkJu7ew', 3276.7, 4346.7, 'Only an altar can overturn an altar', 3882.9, 'Altar Against Altar', 191.0,
   'If your problem is caused by an altar, the only solution will be by another altar.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2024', 11, 'Ue8DypA7nCY', 269.4, 1527.3, 'Silencing demonic altars through righteous priesthood', 789.8, 'The Righteous Altar', 0.0,
   'If you want to blot out the speakings of an altar, you must be ready to become the priest of a righteous altar.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2024', 12, 'i4muOmy9dbA', 6123.1, 7275.8, 'Rising as priests to shut down evil altars', 7213.0, 'Rise Up as a Priest', 4884.0,
   'The intention of God is for you to rise up as a priest in that family and shut down completely the altar.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2024', 13, 'hC-muzeUeC8', 7748.3, 8794.2, 'Raising altars as the Spirit directs', 8370.7, 'The Spirit''s Whisper', 6039.0,
   'Sometimes just a whisper from the Holy Spirit can equip you with what to do and what to do could be raising an altar.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2024', 14, 'xpkX0zNUj1c', 772.5, 1895.2, 'True leadership flows from following Christ', 953.7, 'Authority Through Conformity', 2.0,
   'The authority for him to lead is not in himself. The authority for him to lead is in his conformity to the example of Jesus Christ.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2024', 15, 'WdNoVnJ_f9Q', 0.8, 1026.2, 'Christ''s headship meets every need', 760.7, 'Under Christ''s Administration', 1.0,
   'So the place where God puts a believer when you come into the kingdom of God is under the administration of Christ Jesus and that administration can become anything you need in life and in ministry.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2024', 16, 'ezxpmS3jK00', 2402.4, 3296.8, 'Faith enforces what Christ has paid for', 2843.1, 'Faith Contends With Mountains', 435.0,
   'Faith does not deny the presence of mountains. Faith equips you to be able to contend with mountains, not to deny mountains.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2024', 17, 'R3N9tT6Yrgs', 3846.9, 5033.8, 'Sacrifice gives your altar a voice', 5003.8, 'The Sacrifice You Bring', 1676.0,
   'A priest must have a sacrifice. Your altar is powered by the sacrifice that you bring.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2024', 18, 'sbWL0UVNfp8', 2940.2, 4011.8, 'God''s answer is His Spirit', 3584.7, 'Different Shades of Answers', 713.0,
   'God''s answer is God''s spirit and God''s spirit is God''s answer, but the manifestation of God''s spirit in answers can take on different shades and different colors.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2024', 19, '8KceKlG0JKQ', 612.1, 1852.5, 'Knowing God''s voice within your spirit', 1171.7, 'The Knowing of Revelation', 612.0,
   'It''s purely spiritual, it doesn''t influence your soul. It''s a knowing that is born in the privacy of your heart.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2024', 20, 'PefCUCZDd6s', 60.0, 1245.4, 'New birth awakens your spiritual senses', 167.2, 'Born to Perceive', 60.0,
   'You have spiritual senses built into your spirit man but those spiritual senses will not be mobilized, they will not be activated until you become born again.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2024', 21, 'sHxDjZRDKG0', 1141.4, 2398.2, 'Learning to read the signs God sends', 1599.8, 'Discerning Spiritual Seasons', 1141.0,
   'The thing about spiritual seasons is that if you cannot discern them, you will miss the grace that comes on those seasons.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2024', 22, '6a_UWJSaHYY', 971.5, 2457.2, 'Reading God''s signs and seasons', 1095.0, 'A God of Timings', 1.0,
   'Our God is a God of seasons, it''s a God of timings. You should know when to take your journey'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2023', 1, 'Nem3SWIYtaY', 804.6, 1958.3, 'Honouring God by giving what is His due', 1195.9, 'Things Due to God', 655.0,
   'There are things that are due to God and a man that is going to walk in the protection of God must understand the things that are due to God and must be diligent to make those things available to God.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2023', 2, 'WM3I4KoHbmE', 1651.7, 2693.0, 'Worship that gives God his due', 2290.5, 'Giving God His Due', 50.0,
   'Worship is not just that you came to church. You might have come to church and you did not accomplish worship because you did not give God that which is due him.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2023', 3, 'WNfMpCdhhos', 1000.2, 1839.1, 'Our warfare is fought in the spirit', 1239.1, 'Weapons Not Carnal', 1.0,
   'But you see, the knowledge that you acquire on the soil of your soul has no authority in the realm in which this warfare is fought.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2023', 4, '2FN1-SFZnus', 1853.0, 2788.0, 'Guarding the mind in spiritual warfare', 2177.3, 'The First Domain', 10.0,
   'One of the ways you know you are in a situation of spiritual warfare is what goes on in your mind.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2023', 5, 'c33UbyRjjdo', 2754.4, 4177.6, 'Pulling down mental strongholds with truth', 3819.7, 'Seeking Out the Truth', 90.0,
   'It is only what God has said that is true. So if you are going to confront a stronghold you will begin by seeking out the truth.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2023', 6, 'scgbfRUpFpA', 1702.7, 3160.8, 'Taking every thought captive to Christ', 2120.7, 'Words Over Thoughts', 639.0,
   'No matter how vicious your thoughts are, your words have more authority than your thoughts. So when the thoughts begin to flow, you speak to your thought.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2023', 7, 'e267Y66BeeM', 3915.4, 5045.9, 'Why Satan attacks the body', 4927.1, 'Gateway to the Mind', 537.0,
   'One of the reasons why the devil will want to manipulate your body and put sickness on your body is because that is one of the entry points to your mind.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2023', 8, 'nuBUL6wTXFw', 1174.9, 2147.0, 'Winning spiritual warfare in the mind', 1966.3, 'The Seat of Victory', 598.0,
   'Be transformed, and this transformation happens where? In the mind, and that is a seat of victory for you, because if you lose here you lose on the ground.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2023', 9, 'VVio2QVhe6M', 5796.8, 6934.4, 'Divine prosperity is rooted in righteousness', 6512.9, 'Winning by Righteousness', 1648.0,
   'If you are winning by righteousness it''s going to take a process and what God does in this process is that he builds you. It is only men that are built that can handle greatness.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2023', 10, 'inEaPOZ33qU', 6209.7, 7348.1, 'Divine prosperity is a call to stewardship', 6822.2, 'Stewardship Is Consecration', 3153.0,
   'Stewardship is a modern name for consecration, and the idea of consecration is that you belong to God.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2023', 11, 'lsndT0h6Wts', 6983.7, 8080.8, 'Faithful stewards are trusted with more', 7396.8, 'Not Blessing but Responsibility', 3563.0,
   'When you see more money in your hand, don''t call it blessing, as I will show you in a moment; it is not blessing, it is responsibility.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2023', 12, 'DB5HCXxwUnU', 3928.4, 5382.2, 'Discerning the spiritual roots of hardship', 4168.1, 'The Cursed Ground', 3146.0,
   'If a man''s ground is cursed, it doesn''t matter how much hard work he puts in, it will produce futility.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2023', 13, 'h_rCAOir6Fo', 381.0, 1648.7, 'Honouring God''s word shuts the enemy''s door', 627.4, 'Taking God for Granted', 1.0,
   'Taking God''s word for granted, that is one sure way of opening a spiritual door for spiritual warfare.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2022', 1, 'qpegGg21-BU', 1164.2, 2378.9, 'Why every land needs a watchman', 1169.2, 'Watchmen Guard The Land', 793.0,
   'Part of the personnel that need to be in the place to ensure that the plans of God prosper among the people is a watchman.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2022', 2, 'g2SdSrLOilU', 1670.2, 2848.0, 'Watchers who perceive the enemy''s plans', 2403.5, 'Siege Against the Siege', 17.0,
   'Just like the devil builds a siege, you can also build a siege against the siege of the devil.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2022', 3, 'SFRcIw25LvI', 3277.1, 4497.7, 'Pray in cycles and in detail', 4219.1, 'The Prayer Path', 1433.0,
   'One of the easiest way to waste prayer opportunity is to scatter your focus here and there.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2022', 4, 'ViVcLisPqQg', 1459.4, 2773.2, 'Watchmen learn to read God''s signs', 1828.4, 'Signs Point Beyond', 167.0,
   'Signs do not lead you to themselves but signs are pointing to other things. The ability to read signs and know what it is pointing to is critical for a watchman.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2022', 5, '933u2BomvP4', 2156.4, 3386.2, 'Reading the Spirit''s signs within you', 2660.1, 'Warned Into Prayer', 315.0,
   'The purpose of this sensation, a loss of peace, an agitation or an inner commotion or trouble, is to warn us and to point us to strategic prayer against the work of the enemy.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2022', 6, 'A3YdLXMlRxg', 1667.3, 2761.7, 'Watchmen hear God''s announcements', 1914.8, 'God Makes Announcements', 1648.0,
   'The first thing you will find when you start going close to God is that God will always make announcements as touching what he wants to do.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2022', 7, 'ytFMr9eIBNw', 2546.7, 3317.9, 'Answering God''s summons to come up', 2960.4, 'The Call to Come Up', 2342.0,
   'Where you are we cannot transact, where you are we cannot meet, where you are you cannot access what I want to communicate.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2022', 8, '1XwI2IJCqJk', 2712.9, 3740.0, 'Persistent prayer breaks the seals over hidden wisdom', 3286.8, 'Prayer Breaks the Seal', 1183.0,
   'So if you are consistent in the place of prayer you should enter into the prophetic, you should begin to see things that are sealed.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2022', 9, 'EaOOJH6BdqU', 1753.4, 2867.0, 'Consecration as the first sacrifice', 2456.4, 'Bought and Offered', 3.0,
   'First of all you have an understanding that you are bought, and secondly in view of the fact that you are bought you offer yourself willingly to serve the will of God.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2022', 10, 'iQk18lKUOpc', 6869.0, 8313.8, 'Endurance in prayer brings heaven''s feedback', 7072.4, 'When Clouds Are Full', 6682.0,
   'The principle of condensation is the principle of priesthood. The only time clouds empty themselves upon the earth as rain is when they are full of water.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2022', 11, 'rYKnkqRWJQ4', 505.7, 1719.2, 'The cross watch from nine to noon', 1429.4, 'Turning the Tide', 0.0,
   'In this gate of time you can turn the tide around in nations, in families, in your own personal life.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2022', 12, 'mpxLq-TPr5E', 1651.1, 2790.4, 'The watchman discerns men and movements', 1923.4, 'The Watchman''s First Assignment', 3.0,
   'The first assignment of a watchman is to discern men. Men travel with visitations.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2022', 13, '7eraVTdeAxs', 1302.4, 2558.9, 'Patience, discipline and endurance in watching', 2292.3, 'Three Things to Watch', 0.0,
   'So it takes three things to watch: patience, discipline and an enduring spirit.'),
  ('40-days-of-fasting-and-prayer-2022', 14, 'Vq83-EYrjW8', 4400.8, 5755.1, 'God warns us to keep us on course', 5499.9, 'Heeding Divine Warnings', 2135.0,
   'God needs to warn you so that you can submit to divine direction.'),
